pan class=\"s1\">　　　『きらりん』とよく呼ばれます</span><span class=\"s2\">(´ω`)</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">出身地　広島県</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">　　　　ばりばり広島弁です。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">誕生日　</span><span class=\"s2\">2</span><span class=\"s1\">月</span><span class=\"s2\">20</span><span class=\"s1\">日</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">　　　　</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"s1\">ニャンニャンゼロ</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"s1\">で覚えてね</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">年齢　高校２年生の</span><span class=\"s2\">16</span><span class=\"s1\">歳</sp